sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: standby. Fire-and-forget, no response callback.<br>Filters reset automatically when scanning stops.

    alt Filter by device address
        App->>Node: GapCentral.SetDeviceDiscoveryFilter(<br>filter=address, data=C4:AB:12:34:56:78)
    else Filter by manufacturer-specific data
        App->>Node: GapCentral.SetDeviceDiscoveryFilter(<br>filter=manufacturerSpecificData,<br>data=0x87 0x00 <mfr-payload>)
    else Reset filters
        App->>Node: GapCentral.SetDeviceDiscoveryFilter(filter=none)
    end
